#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/gpio.md:10
msgid "GPIO, pin state and external events"
msgstr "GPIO、引脚状态与外部事件"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/gpio.md:12
msgid ""
"Use the selected GPIO and EXTI faces for authorized pin access and copied "
"event observations. The selected Board owns wiring and electrical "
"authorization; a sampled level or IRQ timestamp retains its declared "
"observation quality."
msgstr ""
"使用所选 GPIO 和 EXTI 接口访问获授权引脚并读取复制的事件观测。选定 Board 负责接线及电气授权；采样电平或 IRQ "
"时间戳保持其声明的观测质量。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/gpio.md:16
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

